<http://www.spektrix.com/factorytheatre/event/146202ASMJCHQGGQQQPGSLCSBBCHRPQJG> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Laura Ramoso: The Calm Down Tour PREVIEWS with post-show Q&A";
  schema:description """
	Laura runs her show for a hometown crowd before she heads out on the North American leg of her <span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Calm Down Tour! w/ post-show live Q&A</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lau_ramoso/\">Laura Ramoso</a> is a German-Italian comedian best known for her live sketch specials and viral impressions on social media. She has amassed over 3 million followers with hit characters like “German Mom,” “Italian Dad,” and “Chiara”. In 2023, she performed an entirely sold-out run at the Edinburgh Fringe Festival and London’s Soho Theatre with her critically-acclaimed second hour, <span class=\"ItalicText\">FRANCES</span>. Laura was named a 2023 Just for Laughs New Face of Comedy. In 2024, she embarked on her first international tour with her third special, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Sit Up Straight</span>, running 60+ sold-out shows throughout Australia, New Zealand, Europe, the UK, Canada, and the US. In 2025, she opened for Tina Fey and Amy Poehler on their Restless Leg tour at the Wang Theatre in Boston. She is currently on the road with her fourth entirely sold out hour, The Calm Down Tour.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Duration: approx. 105 mins (including post-show Q & A)<span><br/></span>Age recommendation: 14+<span><br/></span>Content Warnings: Flashing lights, loud noises, mature content.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-09-01T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/factorytheatre/files/dd152ca0-f9ec-4a89-858b-a891b8c16018.jpg>;
